#17701
Overlooking a guardpost~
You stand upon a small knoll overlooking a guardpost. Soldiers wander
about under the watchful glare of a large outcropping of rock, which 
you now can tell why this is called The Jut for the rock sticks out in
a defensive way that makes it appear to jut out of the forest. Up above
another guardpost can be seen and a long rope dangles down from above.
~
