#17706
Upper Guardpost~
You stand within the upper guardpost. Guards and soldiers wander about 
looking at you suspiciously. All about industry is evident, weapons being
readied. Armor being crafted, the smells of goods baking wafting on the
high winds. Below you can see a mass of shadows encroaching upon the Jut.
Shadowen seem to have followed you up here. Suddenly a cry goes out and the
rope is cut..ending all access back down to the forest. Seems the only exit
is to enter the Jut caverns and find an alternate way down.
~
