#17707
Within the Jut~
You are at the entrance to the Jut. Passageways spread out in all directions.
The smells of fresh bread come from the north and the sounds of metalwork
come from the east. A passing guard suggests that you go see the Man in his
offices to the east and south. "Also a rest area stands to the south for you
to recover from all wounds you may have", he says. "Please do not cause any
trouble while here, go nowhere where you can tell you aren't welcome."
~
