#17723
Entrance to Shady Vale~
Large wooden gates welcome you to the little town of Shady Vale.  A bustling
community tucked away in the confines of the forest you just left, you can see
the activities of many of the towns folks going about their business.  Many
wave to you as you enter the town.  A passerby informs you to try the baked
goods at the baker shop or if in need of weapons or armors to try the stores
owned by the Brohickys, brothers who had taken up different roles early on in
life.  In the distance two large houses can be seen, both look inviting to you.
  
~
