#17735
Small little hut~
Strange smoke wafts out the door as you open it.  It smells as if something
dead is being burned to a crisp and looking over at the fireplace you can see
that something is.  You find it odd that someone would just put on something to
cook then forget about it but scanning the room, piled high with books and
ledgers, you realize a scrawny little guy wearing big thick glasses is hidden
behind one of these piles, completely absorded in his work.  You peer over his
shoulder and see he is making banking account entries.  Slightly shocked you
realize this must be the communities banking office.  Even more shocked you
realize the little man is now staring at you waiting for you to either deposit
your money, withdraw some money, or just get out.    
~
