#17757
Brohicky's Bakery~
Pastries about and cakes and pies of all sizes shapes and flavors to please any
pallet greets your nose and eyes as you pop into the shop, drawn in by the
smells from outside on the street as you passed by.  In one corner stands a
massive wedding cake, adorned with every imaginable decoration that you would
expect to top a cake this grandly made.  Counter-tops and stands line all the
walls and even the middle of this shop displaying all the wares carried and
made lovingly by hand by the man grinning at you as you enter.    
