#17759
The House of Leah~
You stand within the entryway of the once proud and noble house of Leah, the
former rulers of the surrounding countryside of Leah.  Everywhere you look you
see the signs of Federation occupation.  Tapestries torn from their hangings,
pots and vases smashed to pieces, the smell of unuse all about.  This place,
now lived in only by a small garrison of Federation soldiers, shows what all
the countyside around is coming to.    
~
