#17760
Living room~
This area once was the family living room.  Here was where the family rested in
the evening hours after a hard days work.  Now though, the Federation soldiers
have turned this into what looks like a war room.  Maps of the Four Lands lay
spread out on just about every table.  Odd sorts of weaponry and other
equipment lie piled in corners.  Sofas, once glorious to behold, have been torn
open with knives and their insides strewn about the room.    
~
