#17761
Dining room~
This was once the dining hall, used for the grand banquets the former residing
lord Leah used to hold.  Many a memory of long nights with lights shining out
of every window fill all the hearts of the residents of Shady Vale as they
would look up to this place and dream of one day attending.  But now with the
Federation here that dream no longer takes hold.  The once long dining table
has been chopped to bits to fuel the winter fireplaces.  Cabinets, filled with
priceless china all opened and the plates and cups smashed on the floor or
against a wall by some soldiers drunken wimsey.  This place is nothing but torn
up and messy.    
~
177 520 0 0 0 0 255 0
