Trophy Room~
Once the manors trophy room for the families hunts, filled with game and
wildlife from all the lands surrounding, it has now become a trophy room of the
Federation soldiers which camp here.  Treasures of all sorts lie about, taken
from the residents of both Shady Vale and any wandering vagabond found within
the lands about.  All the trophies of old were burned out back shortly after
the occupation by the soldiers.    
~
