once been a rather large and nicely kept kitchen.  You check the icebox but gag
as the smell of rotting meats assail your nose.  The stove, an old iron beast,
has parts missing which you can only assume were melted down to forge weapons
for the many soldiers camped here.  To the west you see what appears to be
stairs leading upward into darkness.    
